Title: A goal is raised out of another
Structure: sequence

# The Inspection

[[id: q1]]

[[goal: save | id: shop | subject: ANNA | object: the shop]]

[[goal: use the name of | id: use-tom | subject: ANNA | object: TOM | for: shop | status: secret]]

INT. SHOP - WORKROOM - DAY

An INSPECTOR turns a cracked valve over in his hand. ANNA and TOM stand side by side. Tom has gone grey.

INSPECTOR
Whoever fitted this could have killed someone. I need a name for the report. It decides your licence.

Tom opens his mouth.

ANNA
I fitted it.

Tom stares at her. The Inspector writes it down.
